  "summary": "singular-lite documents a bash/Python multi-agent orchestration engine with a three-tier scheduling model, an explicit reconcile cycle, gate/audit/decider recovery routing, and a documented session-independence invariant for auditors. Security docs treat repo-configured commands and worktrees as an executable trust boundary.",
